    scoringRules: {
      summary: 'Card points are counted using Briscola values (Ace 11, Three 10, King 4, Queen 3, Jack 2; others 0). In Briscola a 31, play stops as soon as a player claims to have at least 31 points in their tricks; if the claim is correct they win, and if it is incorrect the opponent wins the hand.',
